{
 "root": {
  "type": "col",
  "children": [
   {
    "type": "row",
    "size": 1,
    "children": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " <accent+b>fictty</> <d>tour</>",
      "size": 14
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<pos>◆</>",
      "size": 2,
      "when": "seen=Saturn"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<d>◇</>",
      "size": 2,
      "when": "!seen=Saturn"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<pos>◆</>",
      "size": 2,
      "when": "plan.0.children.0.done"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<d>◇</>",
      "size": 2,
      "when": "!plan.0.children.0.done"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<pos>◆</>",
      "size": 2,
      "when": "items.3"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<d>◇</>",
      "size": 2,
      "when": "!items.3"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<pos>◆</>",
      "size": 2,
      "when": "trash"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<d>◇</>",
      "size": 2,
      "when": "!trash"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<pos>◆</>",
      "size": 2,
      "when": "$theme.name!=glass"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<d>◇</>",
      "size": 2,
      "when": "!$theme.name!=glass"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<pos>◆</>",
      "size": 2,
      "when": "agent_done"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<d>◇</>",
      "size": 2,
      "when": "!agent_done"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<accent+b>◆</>",
      "size": 2,
      "when": "open"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<accent+b>◇</>",
      "size": 2,
      "when": "!open"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<pos>◆</>",
      "size": 2,
      "when": "big_q"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<d>◇</>",
      "size": 2,
      "when": "!big_q"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<d>8/10</>  <b>Pages</> ",
      "align": "right"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "text",
    "text": "<border>{*─}</>",
    "size": 1
   },
   {
    "type": "row",
    "children": [
     {
      "type": "col",
      "title": "8 · Pages",
      "size": 44,
      "variant": "card",
      "children": [
       {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Pages are store entries; links between them are data. A click on <b>[[Page]]</> runs an action, here: open it beside, as one more panel in a sidebar made with <b>each</> (a template per open page). Two editors on one page are one text with one undo.\n\nThe main pane's layout reads <b>$width</>, its own width, not the screen's.",
        "pad": [
         1,
         0
        ]
       },
       {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "\n<accent+b>Try</>\n<d>›</> click a <b>[[link]]</>, shift-click to go there\n<d>›</> <b>Tab</> nests a line, <b>Enter</> continues a list\n<d>›</> type in either copy of a page",
        "pad": [
         1,
         0
        ],
        "size": 6
       },
       {
        "type": "col",
        "size": 5,
        "edge": "rounded",
        "children": [
         {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<pos+b>◆ Quest done.</>\n<b>n</> for the next chapter.",
          "when": "open",
          "pad": [
           1,
           0
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<warn+b>◇ Quest</>\nClick <b>[[Groceries]]</> to open it beside.",
          "when": "!open",
          "pad": [
           1,
           0
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "row",
      "children": [
       {
        "type": "col",
        "children": [
         {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<b>{.}</>",
          "bind": "here",
          "size": 1,
          "pad": [
           1,
           0
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<d>wide: the sidebar is closed, so this pane has the room</>",
          "size": 1,
          "pad": [
           1,
           0
          ],
          "when": "$width>=72"
         },
         {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<d>narrow: the sidebar took room, and this pane switched on its own width</>",
          "size": 1,
          "pad": [
           1,
           0
          ],
          "when": "$width<72"
         },
         {
          "type": "editor",
          "id": "here_page",
          "bind": "here",
          "doc": "page/{.}",
          "syntax": "markdown",
          "tab": "indent-lines",
          "caret": "end",
          "links": [
           {
            "kind": "wiki",
            "click": {
             "do": [
              {
               "remove": "open",
               "where": {
                "id": "{$match}"
               }
              },
              {
               "append": "open",
               "value": {
                "id": "{$match}"
               }
              },
              {
               "put": "flash",
               "value": "{$match}",
               "for_ms": 2500
              },
              {
               "toast": "Opened {$match} beside",
               "tone": "accent"
              }
             ]
            },
            "s-click": {
             "put": "here",
             "value": "{$match}"
            }
           },
           {
            "kind": "tag",
            "click": {
             "toast": "#{$match}: tags are links too",
             "tone": "violet"
            }
           }
          ],
          "border": true
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "type": "col",
        "size": 40,
        "when": "open",
        "children": [
         {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<accent>• {.} just opened</>",
          "bind": "flash",
          "size": 1,
          "when": "flash",
          "pad": [
           1,
           0
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "each",
          "id": "beside",
          "bind": "open",
          "template": {
           "type": "col",
           "id": "panel-{$item.id}",
           "title": "{$item.id}",
           "children": [
            {
             "type": "button",
             "id": "close-{$item.id}",
             "label": "close",
             "size": 1,
             "align": "right",
             "click": {
              "remove": "open",
              "where": {
               "id": "{$item.id}"
              }
             }
            },
            {
             "type": "editor",
             "id": "side-{$item.id}",
             "doc": "page/{$item.id}",
             "syntax": "markdown",
             "tab": "indent-lines",
             "links": [
              {
               "kind": "wiki",
               "click": {
                "do": [
                 {
                  "remove": "open",
                  "where": {
                   "id": "{$match}"
                  }
                 },
                 {
                  "append": "open",
                  "value": {
                   "id": "{$match}"
                  }
                 },
                 {
                  "put": "flash",
                  "value": "{$match}",
                  "for_ms": 2500
                 },
                 {
                  "toast": "Opened {$match} beside",
                  "tone": "accent"
                 }
                ]
               },
               "s-click": {
                "put": "here",
                "value": "{$match}"
               }
              },
              {
               "kind": "tag",
               "click": {
                "toast": "#{$match}: tags are links too",
                "tone": "violet"
               }
              }
             ]
            }
           ]
          }
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "stack",
    "size": 1,
    "children": [
     {
      "type": "row",
      "children": [
       {
        "type": "text",
        "text": " <b>n</> <d>next</>  <b>p</> <d>back</>  <b>tab</> <d>move</>  <b>esc</> <d>leaves a field</>  <b>t</> <d>theme</>  <b>a</> <d>apps</>  <b>q</> <d>quit</>"
       },
       {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "<d>{fps} fps · {msgs} msg/s · {draw_ms} ms a frame</> ",
        "bind": "$stats",
        "align": "right",
        "size": 44
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "toasts"
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
 "keys": {
  "t": {
   "theme": "next"
  },
  "a": {
   "load": "home.json"
  },
  "n": {
   "load": "tour-9-speed.json"
  },
  "p": {
   "load": "tour-7-agents.json"
  }
 },
 "store": {
  "seen": "",
  "plan": [
   {
    "id": "launch",
    "text": "Launch the tour",
    "children": [
     {
      "id": "post",
      "text": "Write the post"
     },
     {
      "id": "demo",
      "text": "Record the demo",
      "children": [
       {
        "id": "script",
        "text": "Script it",
        "done": true
       },
       {
        "id": "shoot",
        "text": "Shoot it"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "id": "ship",
      "text": "Ship it"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "rest",
    "text": "Rest",
    "children": [
     {
      "id": "walk",
      "text": "A long walk"
     },
     {
      "id": "read",
      "text": "A short book"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "later",
    "text": "Someday",
    "children": [
     {
      "id": "sail",
      "text": "Learn to sail"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "items": [
   {
    "name": "Coffee beans",
    "qty": "1",
    "done": true
   },
   {
    "name": "Oat milk",
    "qty": "2",
    "done": false
   },
   {
    "name": "Lemons",
    "qty": "6",
    "done": false
   }
  ],
  "files": [
   {
    "name": "notes.md"
   },
   {
    "name": "draft-v1.md"
   },
   {
    "name": "draft-v2.md"
   },
   {
    "name": "draft-final.md"
   },
   {
    "name": "draft-final-FINAL.md"
   },
   {
    "name": "todo.txt"
   },
   {
    "name": "screenshot.png"
   }
  ],
  "trash": [],
  "confirm": false,
  "doomed": "",
  "agent_done": false,
  "agent_tasks": [
   {
    "id": "read",
    "text": "Read the screen",
    "done": false
   },
   {
    "id": "write",
    "text": "Write a note",
    "done": false
   },
   {
    "id": "point",
    "text": "Point at something",
    "done": false
   },
   {
    "id": "theme",
    "text": "Try a theme",
    "done": false
   }
  ],
  "here": "Home",
  "open": [],
  "flash": "",
  "page/Home": "# Home\n\nA tiny notebook. Click a link to open it beside this one: [[Groceries]], [[Ideas]], [[Trip]].\nShift-click opens it here instead. Tags are links too: #fictty #demo\n\n- Tab nests a line under the one above it\n- Enter on a list item starts the next one\n- [ ] Ctrl-T ticks a task, or makes a line one",
  "page/Groceries": "# Groceries\n\n- [ ] Oat milk\n- [ ] Lemons\n- [x] Coffee beans\n\nBack to [[Home]].",
  "page/Ideas": "# Ideas\n\n- A screen that is one value\n  - agents write it\n  - people type in it\n- More in [[Trip]]",
  "page/Trip": "# Trip\n\n1. Pack light\n2. Train at nine\n3. Read [[Ideas]] on the way",
  "item_name": "",
  "item_qty": "",
  "items_q": "",
  "big_q": "",
  "agentpad": ""
 },
 "status_bar": false,
 "focus": "here_page"
}
